// check: accepted
// CROWN modal (§11 6.3's walk): the install absorbs THROUGH an
// effect-polymorphic HOF — run_it's row var carries the lambda's E to
// the call site, and the enclosing install subtracts it, so the
// declared !E holds. Expect NO E_EffectMismatch.
effect E { op() -> Int }
handler h { op() => resume(7) }
fn run_it(g) = g()
fn f() with !E = (run_it(() => op())) ~> h
fn main() = f()
